Replication package for

Impact of Climate Vulnerability on Fiscal Risk: Do Religious Tensions and Financial Development Matter?
John Beirne (a), Donghyun Park (a), Jamel Saadaoui (b) and Gazi Salah Uddin (c)

June 22nd, 2025

Code by Jamel Saadaoui (jamelsaadaoui@gmail.com)

(a) Economic Research and Development Impact Department, Asian Development Bank, Philippines
(b) University Paris 8, Dionysian Lab of Economics, Institute for European Studies, 93200, Saint-Denis, France
(c) Department of Management & Engineering, Linköping University, SE-581 83 Linköping, Sweden


The estimations have been conducted with Stata 19.5.

***
The folder contains the Stata program (ReplicationEE.do) to replicate all the Figures and Tables in the paper. Open this file in a folder with the data and run it.

***
The Stata files emft-adb-new-v3.dta, emdat.dta, and VUL_N.dta provide the data to replicate all the Figures and Tables in the paper.

